Template: somasave-client/github_pat
Type: password
Description: GitHub Personal Access Token:
 Enter the PAT provided by Jumbostar Solutions to download
 the StudentPocket API. Contact support@jumbostar.co.ke
 if you do not have one.

Template: somasave-client/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: MySQL database host:
 IP address or hostname of the SACCO MySQL server.

Template: somasave-client/db_user
Type: string
Default: somasave_user
Description: MySQL database username:

Template: somasave-client/db_password
Type: password
Description: MySQL database password:

Template: somasave-client/keystore_password
Type: password
Description: SSL keystore password:
 Password for the SSL certificate keystore (server.p12).

Template: somasave-client/truststore_password
Type: password
Description: SSL truststore password:
 Password for the SSL truststore (truststore.p12).

Template: somasave-client/admin_password
Type: password
Description: API admin password:
 Password for the StudentPocket API admin user.
 